---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
const pageTitle = "Slashpages - Thamara Kandabada";
const slashpageImage = "/featured-images/slashpages.png"
---
<PageLayout title={pageTitle} image={slashpageImage}>
  <h1>Slashpages</h1>
    <p>This website is my <a href="https://indieweb.org/digital_garden" target="_blank">“digital garden“</a>—my corner of the internet where I publish thoughts, showcase various interests, run experiments, and archive things for posterity. I treat it as an extension of my offline self. It is completely non-commercial, built with thought and care, and adheres to the <a href="https://indieweb.org" target="_blank">IndieWeb ethos</a>.</p>
    <p>Exploring this digital garden is easy; simply navigate through the various <a href="https://slashpages.net/" target="_blank">slashpages</a>* below. They represent different parts of my personality, interests, and history.</p>
  <h2>About me</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong><a href="/codex">/Codex</a>:</strong> The values and beliefs I live by.</li>
      <li><strong><a href="/now">/Now</a>:</strong> What I am doing now.</li>
      <li><strong><a href="/resume">/Resume</a>:</strong> My professional background and experience.</li>
      <li><strong><a href="/verify">/Verify</a>:</strong> Verification of my online identities.</li>
      <li><strong><a href="/uses">/Uses</a>:</strong> The tools and services I use.</li>
    </ul>
  <h2>Community</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong><a href="/indieweb">/IndieWeb</a>:</strong> Notes and resources on the IndieWeb movement.</li>
      <li><strong><a href="/wwc">/WWC</a>:</strong> A page dedicated to the Web Writers' Collective.</li>
    </ul>
  <h2>Feeds & Collections</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong><a href="/blogroll">/Blogroll</a>:</strong> A list of blogs I follow.</li>
      <li><strong><a href="/desk">/Desk</a>:</strong> The evolution of my desk setup.</li>
      <li><strong><a href="/design">/Design</a>:</strong> A showcase of my design work.</li>
      <li><strong><a href="/experiments">/Experiments</a>:</strong> A testing ground for new features.</li>
      <li><strong><a href="/feeds">/Feeds</a>:</strong> All my RSS feeds that you can subscribe to.</li>
      <li><strong><a href="/film">/Film</a>:</strong> My favourite films.</li>
      <li><strong><a href="/gigs">/Gigs</a>:</strong> Live performances I've been to.</li>
      <li><strong><a href="/guitars">/Guitars</a>:</strong> Notes and information about my guitars.</li>
      <li><strong><a href="/music">/Music</a>:</strong> My favourite music.</li>
      <li><strong><a href="/notebook">/Notebook</a>:</strong> My personal blog.</li>
      <li><strong><a href="https://physicalmedia.thamara.co.uk">/Physical Media Vault</a>:</strong> My physical media collection.</li>
      <li><strong><a href="/podroll">/Podroll</a>:</strong> A list of podcasts I listen to.</li>
      <li><strong><a href="/projects">/Projects</a>:</strong> A list of projects I am and have been involved in.</li>
    </ul>
  <h2>Site info</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong><a href="/accessibility">/Accessibility</a>:</strong> My accessibility statement.</li>
      <li><strong><a href="/ai">/AI</a>:</strong> How I am using (and not using) AI.</li>
      <li><strong><a href="/changelog">/Changelog</a>:</strong> A detailed log of changes made to this website.</li>
      <li><strong><a href="/changelog-legacy">/Changelog (legacy)</a>:</strong> An older version of the changelog (no longer maintained).</li>
      <li><strong><a href="/colophon">/Colophon</a>:</strong> Information on how this website is built.</li>
      <li><strong><a href="/credits">/Credits</a>:</strong> A list of tools and resources used making this website.</li>
      <li><strong><a href="/hello">/Hello</a>:</strong> Get in touch.</li>
      <li><strong><a href="/guestbook">/Guestbook</a>:</strong> A place for visitors to leave messages.</li>
      <li><strong><a href="/sitemap">/Sitemap</a>:</strong> An XML sitemap of this website.</li>
      <li><strong><a href="/slashpages">/Slashpages</a>:</strong> This page.</li>
      <li><strong><a href="/style">/Style</a>:</strong> The style sheet for this website.</li>
      <li><strong><a href="/subdomains">/Subdomains</a>:</strong> Subdomains associated with this website.</li>
    </ul>
  <h2>Other</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong><a href="/404">/404</a>:</strong> A custom 404 page.</li>
      <li><strong><a href="/blank">/Blank</a>:</strong> A blank page.</li>
    </ul>
  <hr>
  <p><em>*Some of these pages are, quite obviously, not widely accepted or standard slashpages, but I have chosen to call them as such. My website, my rules.</em></p>
</PageLayout>
